data: {"answer": "這裡是「農莊近看・感測閘道器」房間，展示的是把農莊接上網路的感測閘道器。請查看標籤上的預設密碼和舊韌體，這兩項都是敞開的門。這個房間藏著 1 個漏洞，你可以繼續探索來尋找它。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "農莊感測器與閘道器是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Farm Sensors & Gateway do?", "zh": "農莊感測器與閘道器是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "不安全的物聯網設備要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent insecure IoT devices?", "zh": "不安全的物聯網設備要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 7.61, "total_s": 7.63}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "farm_near", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "farm_near"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.2}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "farm_near", "label": "Room", "en": "Farm · Up Close", "zh": "農莊近看"}, {"key": "farm_iot", "label": "System", "en": "Farm Sensors & Gateway", "zh": "農莊感測器與閘道器"}, {"key": "iot_default", "label": "Threat", "en": "Insecure IoT Devices", "zh": "不安全的物聯網設備"}, {"key": "patch_management", "label": "Control", "en": "Patch & Vulnerability Management", "zh": "修補與弱點管理"}, {"key": "secure_config", "label": "Control", "en": "Secure Configuration (No Default Passwords)", "zh": "安全組態（不用預設密碼）"}], "edges": [{"a": "farm_iot", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "farm_near"}, {"a": "iot_default", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "farm_iot"}, {"a": "iot_default", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "farm_near"}, {"a": "patch_management", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "farm_near"}, {"a": "patch_management", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "farm_iot"}, {"a": "patch_management", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "iot_default"}, {"a": "secure_config", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "farm_near"}, {"a": "secure_config", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "farm_iot"}, {"a": "secure_config", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "iot_default"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：農莊近看・感測閘道器\n這裡講的是：把農莊接上網路的感測閘道器。\n重點：看一下標籤：預設密碼和舊韌體就是敞開的門。\n這裡的系統：農莊感測器與閘道器\n這裡要注意的威脅：不安全的物聯網設備\n看得到的防護措施：修補與弱點管理、安全組態（不用預設密碼）\n這個房間藏著 1 個漏洞（讓玩家自己找，不要說出來）\n可以走到：薰衣草農莊・智慧感測器", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 7.47, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 660, "prompt_s": 2.31, "gen_tokens": 72, "gen_s": 5.13, "tok_per_s": 14.0, "first_token_s": 2.34}}, "state": {}}

